+# Migration Policy
+
+- Label a removed or renamed public contract as breaking.
+- Name the old contract and its replacement.
+- Tell customers the concrete migration they must perform.
+- State when compatibility or migration proof is missing.
+- Do not soften a breaking change because one contract check passed.
+- Keep migration guidance with the affected release item.
+- Avoid migration advice for changes that preserve the existing contract.
